corrections.original:
This program prints four numbers. Which output is possible?

```c
void *f(void *arg) {
    printf("%d\n", *(int *)arg);
    return NULL;
}

int main(void) {
    pthread_t t[4];
    int i;
    for (i = 0; i < 4; i++)
        pthread_create(&t[i], NULL,
                       f, &i);
    for (int j = 0; j < 4; j++)
        pthread_join(t[j], NULL);
}
```

